This module implements {{T|Documentation}}. Forked from [[wikia:genshin-impact:Module:Documentation]] for use on the Utaite Wiki.

Configuration in [[Module:Documentation/config]].

==Behavior==
The documentation behavior depends on which page it is used on.

On a main template, the documentation displayed will be that of the main template, or which is specified in draft space

On a template draft, the documentation displayed by default will be that of the main, not draft template. Testing of the draft can be done by using the {{F|content}} parameter.

The links generated by the module contain preloads in case the documentation, or draft pages do not exist. The preloads also differ from namespace.
